    <string name="settings_clips_tip">The Clips page (side bar, play symbol) and the home row show the best clips of your channels in one list. Choose whose clips, how far back and how they are sorted. "Relative to channel size" compares each clip with the other clips of its own channel, so a good clip of a small channel can rank next to one of a big channel. The same choices are on the page itself. The list grows while you scroll, and when a clip ends, the next one starts by itself, through the whole list.</string>
